return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'rhg','project-id-version'=>'Babilim 1.2.1','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:33+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:33+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Sent when you press Enable Babilim, and again if the site has to register anew: your site\'s URL, the WordPress, PHP and Babilim versions, the language of your site and the languages in use on it, and a public key generated for this site.'=>'Tui Babilim chalu goro dabile pathay, ar site-ke abar register korono lagile abar pathay: tamar site-or URL, WordPress, PHP ar Babilim-or version, tamar site-or zoban ar tat betar kora zoban, ar ei site-or lagi banai loowa ekkan public key.','Sent on every check: the list of installed plugins and themes with the state of any Babilim translation installed for them, the languages in use, and short diagnostic codes.'=>'Prottek check-ot pathay: install kora plugin ar theme-or list, tar songe tai-r lagi install kora Babilim onubad-or obostha, Betar kora zoban, ar choto diagnostic code.','Every request includes your site\'s URL, and the site\'s access token is included whenever the service needs it.'=>'Prottek request-ot tamar site-or URL thake, ar service-or dorkar poile site-or access token-o thake.','What Babilim sends to the service'=>'Babilim service-ot ki ki fathay','Your site\'s URL'=>'Tamar site-or URL','WordPress version'=>'WordPress version','PHP version'=>'PHP version','Babilim version'=>'Babilim version','Your site\'s language'=>'Tamar site-or zoban','Languages in use on your site'=>'Tamar site-ot betar kora zoban','A public key for this site'=>'Ei site-or lagi ekta public key','A public key generated for this site, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent; the private half stays on your site.'=>'Ei site-or lagi banai loowa ekkan public key, ei request shotti ei site thaki aise eta proman korar lagi. Khali public ongsho pathai; private ongsho tamar site-ot thaki zay.','Installed plugins and themes'=>'Install kora plugin ar theme','For every installed plugin and theme: its name (slug), version, text domain, whether it is listed on WordPress.org, and the languages it already includes. For each Babilim translation you have installed: which version it is, when it was last checked, and whether it passed its file check.'=>'Prottek install kora plugin ar theme-or lagi: tar nam (slug), version, text domain, WordPress.org-ot list kora ase ni na, ar tate agot thaka zoban. Tamar install kora prottek Babilim onubad-or lagi: kon version, sheshe kitiye check korise, ar tar file check pass korise ni na.','Source files (only if you confirm an upload)'=>'Source file (upload goiyar hukum dile hoilei)','Diagnostic codes'=>'Diagnostic code','Up to 20 short diagnostic codes (for example, a translation file that failed its check), each with the plugin or theme, the language and the time it happened. They never contain any text from your site or any translated text.'=>'Besi thaki besi 20 ta choto diagnostic code (zemon, check-ot fail hoibar onubad file), sathe plugin ba theme, zoban ar kitiye hoise tar shomoy. Tate tamar site-or kono lekha ba onubad kora lekha kobhu thake na.','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'এই নেটওয়ার্কর %1$dটা সাইট প্লাগইন মুছি ফেলা অইলে নিজর Babilim পরিচয় মুছি ফেলার লাগি সেট গরা আছে। তখন ওই সাইটর লগে যুক্ত পরিশোধিত লাইসেন্স স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে পুনরুদ্ধার গরা যাইবো না; আপনারে %2$s ঠিকানাত Babilim সহায়তার লগে যোগাযোগ গরিত অইবো। পরিচয় রাখিবার লাগি বাতিল চাপিয়েন, ওই সাইটর Babilim সেটিংসত "আনইনস্টলের সময় Babilim-এর সমস্ত ডেটা মুছে ফেলুন" অপশনর টিক