rets (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key). Code files can still contain text or data you would not want to share; check them if you are unsure. The service removes the same kinds of files again on arrival.'=>'Onno naam ba extension-ot thaka file include kora zai na. uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules ar languages folḍar, hidden file, ar zei file-er naam sādhāron gopon file-er logot mile (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key) hegulin-o include kora zai na. Code file-ot emon text ba data thakibo pare zeta tui share koribo nó chas; shondeho thakile hegulin dekhi lo. File pouchar pore sērvis hemotén file ekbar abar shoriye deyr.','Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site.'=>'Ei site-ot age tuni install hoya plugin ar theme-ar namila torjoma bori dey.','Free'=>'Muft','Free-plan slots'=>'Free-plan slot','General'=>'Shadharon','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'এটা চালু থাকলে আনইনস্টল গরার সময় এই সাইটর পরিচয়ও মুছি যাইবো। এরপর এই সাইটর লগে যুক্ত পরিশোধিত লাইসেন্স স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে পুনরুদ্ধার গরা যাইবো না; এডা ফিরি পাইবার লাগি আপনারে %s ঠিকানাত Babilim সহায়তার লগে যোগাযোগ গরিত অইবো।','Included'=>'অন্তর্ভুক্ত','Included in index'=>'সূচিতে অন্তর্ভুক্ত','Install available translations automatically'=>'উপলব্ধ অনুবাদ স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে ইনস্টল করুন','Installed'=>'Install oi gese','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Install goira thowa translation-undo rakhibo, kintu aar check ba download hoibo na.','Installed · %s'=>'Install kora oiyse · %s','Installed · built for %1$s, this site has %2$s'=>'Install oise · %1$s-or lagi build oise, ei site-ot %2$s ase','Installed · built for %s'=>'ইনস্টল গরা অইছে · %sর লাগি বিল্ড গরা','Installed · built for %s, new version failed'=>'Install oise · %s-or lagi banano, notun version fail oise','Installed · built for %s, new version scheduled'=>'Install oise · %s-or lagi build oise, notun version schedule oise','Installed · built for %s, translating the new version…'=>'ইনস্টল গরা অইছে · %sর লাগি বিল্ড গরা, নতুন ভার্সনর অনুবাদ গরা অইত আছে…','Installed · built for %s; this plugin or theme is no longer covered by the site\'s service plan'=>'Install hoijje · %s-or lagi bonaa; ei plugin noyto theme ar site-or khidmot plan-or bhitore nai','Installed · built for a different version'=>'Install oise · ouro version-or lagi build oise','Installed · built for a different version, new version failed'=>'ইনস্টল গরা অইছে · আরেক ভার্সনর লাগি বিল্ড গরা, নতুন ভার্সনর অনুবাদ ব্যর্থ অইছে','Installed · built for a different version, new version scheduled'=>'Install oise · onno version-or lagi banano, notun version schedule oise','Installed · built for a different version, translating the new version…'=>'ইনস্টল গরা অইছে · আরেক ভার্সনর লাগি বিল্ড গরা, নতুন ভার্সনর অনুবাদ গরা অইত আছে…','Installed · built for a different version; this plugin or theme is no longer covered by the site\'s service plan'=>'Install hoijje · ar ek version-er lagi bonaa; ei plugin noyto theme ar site-or khidmot plan-or bhitore nai','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'Eita service-or hosting provider-e rakhe, ar AI model-e translation banaibar lagi kam kore.','Keep my own translation overrides when purging everything or uninstalling this plugin.'=>'Shob muchi dilé ba ei plugin uninstall goilé, nijor torjoma override rakho.','Language'=>'ভাষা','Language:'=>'Zuban:','Languages'=>'Zuban','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Ei site\'ot pawa zuban: %s.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'Shesh cleanup %1$s: notun mark hoa file %2$d ta, mochha file %3$d ta, shoraano record %4$d ta.','Maintenance'=>'Dekhbhal','Maintenance status is not